<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>30 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>25 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>21 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid), Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>19 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>17 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>16 - Ismael Urzaiz (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>15 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
